{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1000_p", "source_sha256": "34339614b3f8694d02c5bacc7eb6469cb52278ccd19bee70555882b21c1f07c6", "ja": "そろそろ夜明けだけど……。\nジュリア、まだ眠いんじゃないか？", "zh": "差不多要天亮了……\n茱莉亚，你是不是还很困？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "06331c5b6cb1833abdde26b5f94339135b5f6a4050a54777e97c318b691c16e8", "ja": "全然。むしろ、絶好調さ。\nってか、あたしよりあんたの方が心配だぜ？", "zh": "完全不会，反而超有精神的。\n比起我，你更该担心自己吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3f26cbbbcd46089a8e78042313a61d7c476aebaae757f0ccbd15de48279bc498", "ja": "俺が？", "zh": "我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "a6d7e3131fe5736c607a5bf5e6df3d401bc90bb199c54ed0361fd5c7040c0404", "ja": "そう。ほら、ネクタイ曲がってるぜ？", "zh": "没错。你看，你的领带打歪啰？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "3d5be30b9cd493082678ca9c0de9bb50e37f8278377052471ac04d688273ed5c", "ja": "……ほら、これで直った。", "zh": "……好啦，这样就正了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1005_p", "source_sha256": "21d179908dfe1d1b77defe9055ead98e4f8246078b34af324a7a8b436baea6c9", "ja": "お、おお……悪いな。", "zh": "喔、喔喔……真抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "c64a1a1c156ae5338d9ff4b0f0c1229a73c5d99fdb270c730efbc8ddd4c19482", "ja": "準備であんまり寝てないんだろ？\n無茶するな。", "zh": "为了准备，你几乎没有睡吧？\n别勉强自己了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "1acb4b3d8d6ebe0e8d6c0e0013c7afab916815325432711581fbe7842a48ea80", "ja": "後のことは、ウチらに任せればいい。安心しな、\nあんたが寝てても、ちゃんとやりきるさ♪", "zh": "之后的事就交给我们。\n放心吧，就算你在睡觉，我们也能顺利完成的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "27476de82b55633a699ee2fefa9223528e81fc23c1ce950137e09a92818a169b", "ja": "いや、大丈夫。ちゃんと起きてるよ。\nジュリアの演奏を、この目で見届けたいんだ。", "zh": "不，别担心，我很清醒啦。\n我想亲眼见证茱莉亚的演奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "085189c3d31d5b18ce1130c2cdef47b4e0f58f2ee6f04f1c1110c730f9f4ff0f", "ja": "見届けるって……ったく、大げさだな。\nそんな風に言われると、調子が狂うんだけど……。", "zh": "你说亲眼见证……也太夸张了吧。\n被你这么一说，我会失常的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "08f98bd039f6bf90b8d6f4cdd243fb41888542fe66cc8170759437c8296efdf3", "ja": "っと、そろそろ出番みたいだな。\nギターをかき鳴らして、太陽を起こしてやるか。", "zh": "哎呀，好像快轮到我出场了呢。\n我去奏响吉他，唤醒太阳吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0023_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "e527a797fcd68b4fa24e588bfd8879281f766054f3ea34aa59fbaf6c001203bb", "ja": "あんたや太陽が目を覚ますような、\nとびきりのヤツを聴かせてやるから、待ってな♪", "zh": "我会弹出能让你和太阳都清醒的超棒歌曲，\n等着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
